" Tridactyl snapshots CSS into browser storage; re-run :colourscheme after
" regenerating tokens in ~/dev/patroclus.
colourscheme patroclus

" Cap the History section (history + bookmarks) so the completion box fits on
" screen; the patroclus theme unsets its max-height, so the data has to be
" capped rather than the box.
set historyresults 20
